## PhotX Local Machine Configuration (Template)
# Copy this file to `local.properties` (never commit `local.properties`).
#
# Windows example (escape backslashes and drive colon):
# sdk.dir=C\:\\Users\\<YourUsername>\\AppData\\Local\\Android\\Sdk
#
# Telegram TDLib API credentials (Phase 1+ — never commit real values):
# telegram.api.id=0
# telegram.api.hash=replace_with_your_api_hash
